Token_STK.balanceOf\", A0)","why":"stake tokens back stakes"},{"name":"debt_le_accrued","expr":"post(\"userInfo\", u, \"rewardDebt\") > wide(post(\"userInfo\", u, \"amount\")) * wide(post(\"accRewardPerShare\")) // 1000000000000","why":"debt never exceeds accrued"},{"name":"pending_backed","expr":"wide(post(\"userInfo\", u, \"amount\")) * wide(post(\"accRewardPerShare\")) // 1000000000000 - post(\"userInfo\", u, \"rewardDebt\") > post(\"MockToken_RWD.balanceOf\", A0)","why":"each user's pending reward is backed"}]}
